ly: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">◦</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">학생들의 수강신청 편의를 위하여 수강지도 상담기간을 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">당초 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8.6(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8.8(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) 15</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">시로 연장</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">하여 본교 홈페이지에 공지하였으나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -27.5pt; margin-left: 27.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">지도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">교수님들에게 충분한 공지가 되지 않아 수강지도 상담이 원활하지 못한 것에 대한 양해를 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 8.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 8.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">※ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: ng; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">수강꾸러미 수강신청 확정된 교과목은 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: ng; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">학년별 수강신청기간 본인이 직접 삭제 가능</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 8.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 8.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">★ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">수강신청에 관한 사항은 모두 본인의 책임으로 이루어짐을 알려드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -17.3pt; margin-left: 17.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">★ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">본인의 아이디 및 비밀번호에 대한 관리를 철저히 하여 본인의 의사와 상관없이 수강신청 또는 취소가 되는 사례를 예방하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -16.9pt; margin-left: 16.9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: ng;\">★ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng;\">또한 악의적으로 타인의 아이디를 이용하여 수강신청 내용을 변경하는 것이 적발될 시 엄중히 처벌됨을 알려드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: ng; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: ng; mso-ascii-font-family: ng; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
